  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/greater-resolve.webp
  Description: Your time spent in contemplation of the mysteries of creation has
    given you a powerful mind and soul. Your proficiency rank for Will saves increases
    to legendary. When you roll a success on a Will save, you get a critical success
    instead. When you roll a critical failure on a Will save, you get a failure instead.
    When you fail a Will save against a damaging effect, you take half damage.
